          "title": "地下小镇",
          "content": "<p>澳大利亚南部内陆有一个名叫库伯佩迪（Coober Pedy）的小镇。它最初是一个蛋白石矿场，现在已经停止开采了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202106/bg2021062007.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>该镇的夏季地表温度接近50摄氏度，为了躲避酷暑，许多居民都搬到地下的矿洞里面居住，已经有100年历史了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202106/bg2021062002.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>当地的地面上，到处都是烟囱和通气孔。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202106/bg2021062003.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>人们则是在地下安家，客厅、卧室、厨房，一应俱全。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202106/bg2021062004.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202106/bg2021062005.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202106/bg2021062006.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>酒吧、教堂、商店、旅馆、娱乐设施等也在地下，整个小镇可以都在地下运作，不到地面活动。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202106/bg2021062008.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202106/bg2021062009.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202106/bg2021062010.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202106/bg2021062011.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "地下小镇",
              "url": "https://www.businessinsider.com/inside-coober-pedy-australias-underground-town-2016-1"
            }
